    <string name="home_instructions_text">1. Complete the required permissions, then enable the floating capture button on the home screen.\n2. Open the app or game you want to capture, then tap the floating button to open capture settings.\n3. For first use, run Auto-detect once and wait for it to finish.\n4. Check and adjust the capture, stitch, and swipe regions manually, then start capture when the bounds are correct.\n5. Save the verified configuration as a template for quick reuse next time.</string>
